WEBVTT

00:00:01.767 --> 00:00:03.590
Your agent only knows a name.

00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:06.700
ENS turns it into a website and a wallet.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:09.951
The website has two files, both signed by that wallet.

00:00:09.951 --> 00:00:11.967
Now you know who answers.

00:00:11.967 --> 00:00:13.116
Your agent asks.

00:00:13.116 --> 00:00:14.591
The other agent sets a price.

00:00:14.591 --> 00:00:17.733
Yours signs, but no money moves yet.

00:00:17.733 --> 00:00:19.718
The agent answers, then takes the payment.

00:00:19.718 --> 00:00:22.067
No answer, no charge.

00:00:22.067 --> 00:00:24.739
Same protocol, any runtime.
